<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>90 Day Yoga — Support</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Support page for 90 Day Yoga. FAQs, contact, troubleshooting, and policies." />
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#0b0f1a;--card:#121a2b;--text:#e8eefc;--muted:#a9b6d6;--link:#7aa7ff;--ok:#38d39f}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Inter,Arial,sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#070a12, #0b0f1a);color:var(--text)}
    .wrap{max-width:920px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 18px 70px}
    header{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap}
    h1{margin:0;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:.2px}
    .badge{font-size:12px;color:var(--ok);border:1px solid rgba(56,211,159,.35);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:18px}
    @media(min-width:860px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr}}
    .card{background:rgba(18,26,43,.92);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-radius:16px;padding:18px}
    h2{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:16px;color:#cfe0ff}
    p,li{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55}
    a{color:var(--link);text-decoration:none}
    a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
    .btns{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}
    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(122,167,255,.14);border:1px solid rgba(122,167,255,.28)}
    .small{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
    .hr{height:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);margin:14px 0}
    code{background:rgba(0,0,0,.25);padding:2px 6px;border-radius:8px}
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div>
        <h1>90 Day Yoga — Support</h1>
        <div class="small">Help, FAQs, and contact</div>
      </div>
      <div class="badge">Response: 24–72h</div>
    </header>

    <div class="grid">
      <section class="card">
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Need help? Email us and include your device model, iOS version, and the app version.
        </p>
        <div class="btns">
          <!-- TODO: Replace with your real support email -->
          <a class="btn" href="mailto:batikankursat@oultook.com?subject=90%20Day%20Yoga%20Support">Email Support</a>
          <a class="btn" href="#faq">View FAQ</a>
          <a class="btn" href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>
        </div>

        <div class="hr"></div>

        <h2 id="troubleshooting">Quick Troubleshooting</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><b>App freezes / stuck screen:</b> force close and reopen. If it continues, restart the phone.</li>
          <li><b>Notifications not working:</b> iOS Settings → Notifications → 90 Day Yoga → Allow Notifications.</li>
          <li><b>No sound / audio cues:</b> check Silent mode and in-app audio settings (if available).</li>
          <li><b>Purchase not recognized:</b> restore purchases from the app (or contact support with Apple receipt).</li>
          <li><b>Data missing:</b> ensure iCloud / device storage is available; send logs if app has an export option.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="hr"></div>

        <h2 id="refund">Refunds</h2>
        <p>
          Purchases are managed by Apple. Refund requests must be submitted through Apple:
          <a href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">reportaproblem.apple.com</a>
        </p>
      </section>

      <aside class="card">
        <h2 id="faq">FAQ</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><b>How do I start a program?</b> Open the app → select Level → Day 1 → Start.</li>
          <li><b>Can I repeat a day?</b> Yes. You can replay any session anytime.</li>
          <li><b>Do I need an account?</b> No account required (unless you add one later).</li>
          <li><b>How to change language?</b> iOS Settings → 90 Day Yoga → Language (if enabled) or device language.</li>
          <li><b>How to report a bug?</b> Email support with steps + screenshots + app version.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="hr"></div>

        <h2>App Info</h2>
        <p class="small">
          App: <b>90 Day Yoga</b><br />
          Platform: iOS<br />
          Support hours: Mon–Fri
        </p>

        <div class="hr"></div>

        <h2>Legal</h2>
        <p class="small">
          This app does not provide medical advice. Consult a professional before starting any fitness program.
        </p>
        <p class="small">
          <a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>
          <!-- Optional: add Terms -->
          <!-- · <a href="terms.html">Terms</a> -->
        </p>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <p class="small" style="margin-top:18px;">
      Tip: If Apple asks for “Support URL”, use this page URL. If they ask for “Privacy Policy URL”, use <code>/privacy.html</code>.
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
